			(property "Description" "Raspberry Pi 5 40-pin GPIO header. Pins are NAMED by GPIO number (GPIO0-GPIO27, 3V3, 5V, GND) and NUMBERED by physical header position (1-40, matching a bare 2x20 2.54mm header footprint's own pad numbering) -- deliberately, so the GPIO map (spec Sec.4) is checkable by eye against a placed instance rather than against header position numbers. Physical-position mapping matches hardware/gen/gen_mule.py's GPIO_PHYSICAL_PIN table."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
